        "ggrHHYhxxS4_text": "<p>If you're on blood thinners, blood pressure medication, or diabetes medication, please consult your healthcare provider first.</p>",
        "ggJbZr565_u_text": "<p>We offer a 90-day \"Feel The Difference\" guarantee. Full refund, no questions asked, even if the bottle is empty.</p>",
        "ggmO4sNTttZ_text": "<p>Yes! All orders ship in plain, unmarked packaging.</p>"
      }
    },
